# Force LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows with core.autocrlf=true converts every file
# to CRLF, and `npm run check` then fails its Prettier step on ~90 untouched
# template files because Prettier expects LF. Pinning it here keeps the check
# meaningful instead of permanently red.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
